  "notes": "{運搬|うんぱん} refers to moving goods or materials from one place to another.\n\nWORD COMPOSITION:\n- {運|うん}: carry, transport\n- {搬|ぱん}: convey, carry\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {運搬|うんぱん}する: to transport, to convey\n- {運搬|うんぱん}{費用|ひよう}/{運搬|うんぱん}{費|ひ}: transportation cost\n- {運搬|うんぱん}{車|しゃ}: transport vehicle\n- {運搬|うんぱん}{業者|ぎょうしゃ}: transport company, carrier\n- {運搬|うんぱん}{作業|さぎょう}: transport work\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {輸送|ゆそう}: transportation (more formal, larger scale)\n- {配送|はいそう}: delivery\n- {運送|うんそう}: shipping, freight",
